0T09:30:56Z"},"message":"Add LOCAL-DEMO.md: map self-contained vs Coston2 deploy paths\n\nFindings from build session:\n- tee-proxy GitLab registry image is private (access forbidden); rebuilt from\n  public github.com/flare-foundation/tee-proxy source as tee-proxy:local.\n- extension-tee:local builds clean in Docker (MODE=1 simulated, pinned tee-node).\n- Every documented round-trip (incl. local-simulated) needs Coston2 indexer DB\n  creds — the README's 'ask the Flare team' gate, not a spend gate. GCP only\n  needed for production attestation ($300 new-acct credit covers it).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"75c47fd5fcdbc87bccafded880282aa5fbd41449","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luongs3/flare-confidential-settle/git/trees/75c47fd5fcdbc87bccafded880282aa5fbd41449"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luongs3/flare-confidential-settle/git/commits/8b4b10c7e9d9d18522737f05d5aa1488b69073b7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luongs3/flare-confidential-settle/commits/8b4b10c7e9d9d18522737f05d5aa1488b69073b7","html_url":"https://github.com/luongs3/flare-confidential-settle/commit/8b4b10c7e9d9d18522737f05d5aa1488b69073b7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luongs3/flare-confidential-settle/commits/8b4b10c7e9d9d18522737f05d5aa1488b69073b7/comments","author":{"login":"luongs3","id":12150725,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTUwNzI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12150725?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luongs3","html_url":"https://github.com/luongs3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luongs3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luongs3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luongs3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luongs3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscripti